rson in position 2 drink?**  \n   → Coffee\n\n4. **What job does the person who drinks juice have?**  \n   → Juice is in position 1 → job is musician\n\nSo the answers in order are:  \n1, fisherman, coffee, musician\n\nFinal answer format:  \n<solution>1, fisherman, coffee, musician</solution>\n\nFinal answer: <solution>1, fisherman, coffee, musician</solution>", "logprobs": [{"token": "We", "logprob": -0.06196817383170128}, {"token": " are", "logprob": -0.04872165620326996}, {"token": " told", "logprob": -0.9740785360336304}, {"token": " there", "logprob": -0.040164850652217865}, {"token": " are", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " two", "logprob": -0.9854435324668884}, {"token": " people", "logprob": -2.884823152271565e-05}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.0031055815052241087}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.01827193610370159}, {"token": " line", "logprob": -4.768370445162873e-07}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.00034231049357913435}, {"token": " numbered", "logprob": -0.04521962255239487}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.07409241795539856}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " (", "logprob": -0.023261984810233116}, {"token": "left", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": ")", "logprob": -0.0009115354623645544}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.1602240949869156}, {"token": " ", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "2", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " (", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "right", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ").", "logprob": -0.06197691336274147}, {"token": " Each", "logprob": -0.127141073346138}, {"token": " has", "logprob": -0.007606353145092726}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.9969286322593689}, {"token": " unique", "logprob": -6.9141146923357155e-06}, {"token": " value", "logprob": -0.1539001762866974}, {"token": " for", "logprob": -4.51792984677013e-05}, {"token": " each", "logprob": -1.0676853656768799}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.12693297863006592}, {"token": " three", "logprob": -0.030684957280755043}, {"token": " attributes", "logprob": -3.933898824470816e